msgid "bool"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/worker_mode.rst:193
msgid ""
"Whether to force garbage collection after each request. ``true`` "
"(default, recommended): Prevents memory leaks. ``false``: Relies on PHP's"
" automatic garbage collection."
msgstr ""

